    "body": "# [4.48.0](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/compare/v4.47.0...v4.48.0) (2026-11-10)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **ci:** complete sample consumer verification ([73469a6](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/73469a690222b804a8676a7e14c6a80f8ab71213))\n* **ci:** fail release gates closed on cancellation and unprocessed SARIF ([fa5f487](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/fa5f48734ca44ce63b55fc645f53c9c6bdccaa1c))\n* **ci:** harden release gate deadlines and outcome handoff ([ce726ae](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/ce726ae24ba876069ca5d5e71a84c7e0085670a4))\n* **ci:** protect publish spike credentials across HTTP redirects ([66a617f](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/66a617fec147bcba633e65b79ab7a0d46f15c907))\n* **ci:** reject publish spike metadata redirects and cover registry reads ([ec97b6b](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/ec97b6be56b46795ffd454067b72dc0ff4b14b3a))\n* **ci:** verify numeric GitHub pagination aliases ([feef50a](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/feef50a50870efb288002471293f76ab461f08a3))\n* **ci:** verify pinned Skopeo source commit in version output ([0705088](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/0705088e92d6703232e62dcbe44b3bf0a0980ee3))\n* **module:** correct lifecycle reporting after review ([4ce510b](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/4ce510b2b263f8e4ea469638a130f08776ba27a3))\n* **module:** harden attached-suite supervision after review ([ca84226](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/ca842264ae91b38fd35c095147d8fbcbda79bb6e))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* build a frozen release payload and create its marked draft ([4dd100c](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/4dd100c62ee8d5dd2952cfaa5c2516245d5e1c1c))\n* **ci:** add isolated publish archive spike helpers ([b260185](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/b260185ebe0d0dd1ae9507b16f2b49b366ccd47c))\n* **ci:** add reusable release gates and outcome reporting ([796e5db](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/796e5dbc4e4554a90aa6a07d20c096a6c5c94298))\n* **ci:** test sample consumer and prepare Windows jobs ([93c9db2](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/93c9db2e2892be80ab8595052b91cbda5b7d158f))\n* **module:** report lifecycle observations ([f118c24](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/f118c2440101fe67be2c7f7a569cbe2257223a16))\n* **module:** supervise runner-owned attached declared-suite runs ([08db49e](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/08db49e8c525d3a8f6116eb4b8b11278d415598b))\n\nhexalith-release: c244eb55729947d293cfbc8837166086eb83df37\nhexalith-release-run: 42919132649\nhexalith-release-artifact: 13810653539 sha256:941ff9943e9429201c9f2b4dceede13630c1d3cb2d1e9f3fefa7373e9d1e46c8\nhexalith-release-packages: Hexalith.Release.CreateMode.Disposable\nhexalith-release-containers: \n",
